{"logId": "d9f71157-b05e-48b6-911e-703f3fbafa92", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "三、网络欺诈事件：", "block_bbox": [156, 222, 356, 251], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[156.0, 222.0], [356.0, 222.0], [356.0, 251.0], [156.0, 251.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "案例：", "block_bbox": [175, 262, 248, 287], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[175.0, 262.0], [247.0, 262.0], [247.0, 286.0], [175.0, 286.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、2018年，一员工在微信聊天中轻易相信网友的言语，被骗现金5000元；", "block_bbox": [156, 297, 511, 360], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[156.0, 297.0], [511.0, 297.0], [511.0, 360.0], [156.0, 360.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、2018年，一员工因在网络上泄露个人信息，导致其银行卡被盗刷10000元。", "block_bbox": [155, 367, 509, 466], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[155.0, 367.0], [509.0, 367.0], [509.0, 466.0], [155.0, 466.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [751, 189, 976, 365], "block_id": 4, "block_order": null, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[751.0, 189.0], [976.0, 189.0], [976.0, 365.0], [751.0, 365.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [775, 390, 1028, 581], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[775.0, 390.0], [1028.0, 390.0], [1028.0, 581.0], [775.0, 581.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "网络欺诈事件的预防和处理：", "block_bbox": [139, 775, 425, 805], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[139.0, 775.0], [425.0, 775.0], [425.0, 805.0], [139.0, 805.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "（一）利用通信实施诈骗犯罪", "block_bbox": [144, 814, 405, 841], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[144.0, 814.0], [405.0, 814.0], [405.0, 841.0], [144.0, 841.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一是电话类：主要是冒充熟人打电话。", "block_bbox": [138, 849, 469, 875], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[138.0, 849.0], [469.0, 849.0], [469.0, 875.0], [138.0, 875.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "二是短信类：主要包括中奖短信和消费短信两种。", "block_bbox": [138, 884, 568, 911], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[138.0, 884.0], [568.0, 884.0], [568.0, 911.0], [138.0, 911.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "三是微信类：主要利用微信GPS定位查找附近千米之内使用微信的用户，并发出见面邀请实施犯罪。", "block_bbox": [137, 919, 603, 983], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[137.0, 919.0], [603.0, 919.0], [603.0, 983.0], [137.0, 983.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "（二）利用网络实施诈骗犯罪", "block_bbox": [143, 991, 404, 1018], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[143.0, 991.0], [404.0, 991.0], [404.0, 1018.0], [143.0, 1018.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一是网络购物类。犯罪分子在互联网交易平台开办网店低价出售数码产品、化妆品、装饰品等价格较高的商品。", "block_bbox": [137, 1027, 600, 1124], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[137.0, 1027.0], [600.0, 1027.0], [600.0, 1124.0], [137.0, 1124.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "二是征婚交友类。犯罪分子通过网络婚姻媒介，编造虚假身份，在骗取对方信任、确立交往关系后，选择时机提出各种理由，骗取钱财后便销声匿迹。", "block_bbox": [136, 1133, 602, 1233], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[136.0, 1133.0], [602.0, 1133.0], [602.0, 1233.0], [136.0, 1233.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [719, 820, 1071, 1099], "block_id": 14, "block_order": null, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[719.0, 820.0], [1071.0, 820.0], [1071.0, 1099.0], [719.0, 1099.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [939, 1211, 1122, 1256], "block_id": 15, "block_order": null, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[939.0, 1211.0], [1122.0, 1211.0], [1122.0, 1256.0], [939.0, 1256.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8543944358825684, "coordinate": [156, 222, 356, 251], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[156.0, 222.0], [356.0, 222.0], [356.0, 251.0], [156.0, 251.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7763471007347107, "coordinate": [175, 262, 248, 287], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[175.0, 262.0], [247.0, 262.0], [247.0, 286.0], [175.0, 286.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9065464735031128, "coordinate": [156, 297, 511, 360], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[156.0, 297.0], [511.0, 297.0], [511.0, 360.0], [156.0, 360.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9040225744247437, "coordinate": [155, 367, 509, 466], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[155.0, 367.0], [509.0, 367.0], [509.0, 466.0], [155.0, 466.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.8907907009124756, "coordinate": [751, 189, 976, 365], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[751.0, 189.0], [976.0, 189.0], [976.0, 365.0], [751.0, 365.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9128033518791199, "coordinate": [775, 390, 1028, 581], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[775.0, 390.0], [1028.0, 390.0], [1028.0, 581.0], [775.0, 581.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8069546818733215, "coordinate": [139, 775, 425, 805], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[139.0, 775.0], [425.0, 775.0], [425.0, 805.0], [139.0, 805.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7984616756439209, "coordinate": [144, 814, 405, 841], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[144.0, 814.0], [405.0, 814.0], [405.0, 841.0], [144.0, 841.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8033757209777832, "coordinate": [138, 849, 469, 875], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[138.0, 849.0], [469.0, 849.0], [469.0, 875.0], [138.0, 875.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8181426525115967, "coordinate": [138, 884, 568, 911], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[138.0, 884.0], [568.0, 884.0], [568.0, 911.0], [138.0, 911.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.892454206943512, "coordinate": [137, 919, 603, 983], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[137.0, 919.0], [603.0, 919.0], [603.0, 983.0], [137.0, 983.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8481348156929016, "coordinate": [143, 991, 404, 1018], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[143.0, 991.0], [404.0, 991.0], [404.0, 1018.0], [143.0, 1018.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.941400945186615, "coordinate": [137, 1027, 600, 1124], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[137.0, 1027.0], [600.0, 1027.0], [600.0, 1124.0], [137.0, 1124.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9428085684776306, "coordinate": [136, 1133, 602, 1233], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[136.0, 1133.0], [602.0, 1133.0], [602.0, 1233.0], [136.0, 1233.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9384512305259705, "coordinate": [719, 820, 1071, 1099], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[719.0, 820.0], [1071.0, 820.0], [1071.0, 1099.0], [719.0, 1099.0]]}, {"cls_id": 9, "label": "footer_image", "score": 0.6827927827835083, "coordinate": [939, 1211, 1122, 1256], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[939.0, 1211.0], [1122.0, 1211.0], [1122.0, 1256.0], [939.0, 1256.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 三、 网络欺诈事件：\n\n## 案例：\n\n1、2018年，一员工在微信聊天中轻易相信网友的言语，被骗现金5000元；\n\n2、2018年，一员工因在网络上泄露个人信息，导致其银行卡被盗刷10000元。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_751_189_976_365.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"18%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_775_390_1028_581.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"21%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 网络欺诈事件的预防和处理：\n\n## （一） 利用通信实施诈骗犯罪\n\n一是电话类：主要是冒充熟人打电话。\n\n二是短信类：主要包括中奖短信和消费短信两种。\n\n三是微信类：主要利用微信GPS定位查找附近千米之内使用微信的用户，并发出见面邀请实施犯罪。\n\n## （二） 利用网络实施诈骗犯罪\n\n一是网络购物类。犯罪分子在互联网交易平台开办网店低价出售数码产品、化妆品、装饰品等价格较高的商品。\n\n二是征婚交友类。犯罪分子通过网络婚姻媒介，编造虚假身份，在骗取对方信任、确立交往关系后，选择时机提出各种理由，骗取钱财后便销声匿迹。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_719_820_1071_1099.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"29%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_751_189_976_365.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//d9f71157-b05e-48b6-911e-703f3fbafa92/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_751_189_976_365.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A52%3A09Z%2F-1%2F%2F5c90a177d9852453d6c0962490525bf6c7c243be6dd22cc5ab209e59ba27f13a", "imgs/img_in_image_box_775_390_1028_581.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//d9f71157-b05e-48b6-911e-703f3fbafa92/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_775_390_1028_581.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A52%3A09Z%2F-1%2F%2F6d90c352e2a77c713e7da258c3a1c58e4d21f9fd52e98f163ffda741f425937c", "imgs/img_in_image_box_719_820_1071_1099.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//d9f71157-b05e-48b6-911e-703f3fbafa92/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_719_820_1071_1099.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A52%3A09Z%2F-1%2F%2Ffb4cf9532bb821a8ad2951675b9aef6372315f7d7b1842414e0c1231438980f6", "imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_939_1211_1122_1256.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//d9f71157-b05e-48b6-911e-703f3fbafa92/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_939_1211_1122_1256.jpg?author